        Habits, not cron
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-mist mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        A cron job runs a script. A habit is the agent checking in with itself. The difference is what the agent has when the turn starts.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mist mt-4">Ari Mendelow &middot; April 2026</p>
